00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:46,460
learning, which is a subfield in AI.

40
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:47,780
And

41
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:51,100
when we talk about machine learning, we think about a whole bunch of things,

42
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:52,880
decision trees, random forests, so on.

43
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:57,080
But again, we're thinking mainly now about what we call deep learning,

44
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:01,580
which includes neural networks and transformers and large language models, as

45
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,240
