133
00:11:08,432 --> 00:11:10,992
But as you've seen, it's just a word predictor. It doesn't know what's true.

134
00:11:11,172 --> 00:11:12,292
It doesn't reason. It doesn't think.

135
00:11:12,852 --> 00:11:13,152
So

136
00:11:14,632 --> 00:11:18,432
if we start with a sentence, "Hymenoptera is a" something, and you

137
