00:11:42,052 --> 00:11:42,952
How would you decide?

146
00:11:44,152 --> 00:11:46,332
These words are all fine. They're in the right order, roughly.

147
00:11:46,772 --> 00:11:48,672
There's a grammatical mistake in the second one.

148
00:11:49,752 --> 00:11:52,232
But in general, these are fine answers.

149
00:11:52,452 --> 00:11:55,872
The words presumably are likely in the distribution.

150
00:11:56,232 --> 00:11:57,472
So how would you score these two?

151
00:11:58,532 --> 00:11:59,512
And the third example,

152
00:12:01,072 --> 00:12:02,852
I think that's fair to say.

