1332
01:20:48,858 --> 01:20:50,538
So using the Smart Wilds dataset,

1333
01:20:52,478 --> 01:20:56,338
I came up with a method to use

1334
01:20:56,378 --> 01:21:00,258
synchronized traces to understand these

1335
01:21:00,318 --> 01:21:03,938
coupled provisioning decisions before expensive field

1336
01:21:04,058 --> 01:21:04,758
trials.

1337
01:21:06,018 --> 01:21:09,077
The choice of model, hardware, the sensor

1338
