01:21:54,198 --> 01:21:57,418
So in summary, cross-modal coordination can

1351
01:21:57,678 --> 01:21:59,678
assist in scaling data collection,

1352
01:22:00,538 --> 01:22:02,258
enable real-time adaptivity,

1353
01:22:03,098 --> 01:22:06,338
support non-invasive monitoring, and advance

1354
01:22:06,518 --> 01:22:08,578
