Research Institute of the Polish Academy of Sciences in

1374
01:23:40,118 --> 01:23:43,958
Bialowieza, and that is where we develop Trapper, open-source

1375
01:23:43,978 --> 01:23:46,198
software for managing camera trapping projects.

