Those are European bison from the Bialowieza forest, and you can see approximations

1425
01:26:39,842 --> 01:26:43,762
of the skeletons as well. And when you click on one of these bounding boxes on the

1426
01:26:43,802 --> 01:26:47,482
right-hand side, a form appears, and that's when an expert can

1427
01:26:47,542 --> 01:26:50,262
either correct or input any information that they want to.

1428
01:26:51,262 --> 01:26:52,462
So that's the Trapper

1429
01:26:53,322 --> 01:26:54,382
