01:28:28,582 --> 01:28:30,782
Maybe I'll just jump to code if you're taking pictures.

1458
01:28:31,642 --> 01:28:35,322
So depth estimation, that's the models that tell you how far the animal is from the

1459
01:28:35,362 --> 01:28:35,622
camera,

1460
