write a simple Python connector class,

1470
01:29:13,802 --> 01:29:17,721
map models data to Trapper internal data, and then you

1471
01:29:17,762 --> 01:29:21,721
can plug in new models as well. So as soon as new open source models pop up, we can

1472
01:29:21,762 --> 01:29:22,502
have them in Trapper.

1473
01:29:24,342 --> 01:29:28,222
As I told you, Trapper is scalable, so depending on the resources you have and on

1474
01:29:28,262 --> 01:29:31,582
the amount of media that you have to process, you can deploy Trapper on different

1475
01:29:31,662 --> 01:29:32,122
platforms.

1476
