If neither internet nor electricity are an issue, you

1477
01:29:37,482 --> 01:29:41,342
can use powerful cloud servers or bare metal servers to deploy Trapper.

1478
01:29:42,302 --> 01:29:46,182
In the environments where internet access may not be that

1479
01:29:46,222 --> 01:29:50,202
reliable, you can use local machines to deploy Trapper as

1480
01:29:50,262 --> 01:29:53,422
well. So it's either a personal computer or hardware like Nvidia Spark.

