1512
01:31:41,394 --> 01:31:45,314
computation, is a good way to ensure data

1513
01:31:45,354 --> 01:31:49,054
privacy and data security, and maybe most importantly,

1514
01:31:49,414 --> 01:31:53,334
in a world with a rapidly changing climate, we cannot really ignore

1515
01:31:53,374 --> 01:31:55,754
the ecological impacts of large data center.

1516
01:31:56,094 --> 01:31:59,934
So we believe that edge computation is the future of responsible

1517
01:32:00,194 --> 01:32:00,754
AI use.

1518
01:32:02,714 --> 01:32:04,094
Hence, devices like that.

