2603
03:23:41,150 --> 03:23:45,110
It's a pleasure for me to be here to show you the workflow

2604
03:23:45,190 --> 03:23:48,830
that we developed to improve the georeferencing a

2605
03:23:48,910 --> 03:23:51,850
posteriori of herbarium specimens.

2606
03:23:52,430 --> 03:23:56,370
The idea for this project came about a couple of years

2607
03:23:56,430 --> 03:23:56,650
ago

2608
03:23:57,530 --> 03:24:01,470
when Italy founded the digitization of 12

2609
03:24:01,590 --> 03:24:05,570
of the largest herbaria of the country, for a total of about

2610
03:24:05,770 --> 03:24:09,370
four million specimens. The project was divided

2611
