2619
03:24:41,230 --> 03:24:44,930
fundamental questions: what was collected, when,

2620
03:24:45,350 --> 03:24:49,310
and where. And for the last question, you have to consider

2621
03:24:49,390 --> 03:24:53,310
that locality in herbaria often are simple

2622
