important for a lot of different analysis.

2625
03:25:03,090 --> 03:25:05,450
For example, species distribution models.

2626
03:25:06,130 --> 03:25:09,690
So we started a process of georeferencing a

2627
03:25:09,730 --> 03:25:11,990
posteriori with different tools,

2628
03:25:12,930 --> 03:25:16,670
and the results we got were not so great.

2629
