Using OpenStreetMap tonumina teams, we were able to

2630
03:25:20,590 --> 03:25:24,170
georeference less than 10% of the tested

2631
03:25:24,230 --> 03:25:27,810
records and about 50% using the

2632
03:25:27,890 --> 03:25:31,430
