2633
03:25:31,470 --> 03:25:34,190
later that here, there are some problems.

2634
03:25:35,290 --> 03:25:38,889
I've used this tool a lot in the past with way better results.

2635
03:25:39,329 --> 03:25:43,209
So I started wondering why the results were so

2636
03:25:43,269 --> 03:25:47,170
