2686
03:28:37,630 --> 03:28:41,310
Here we extract up to 10 candidates

2687
03:28:41,390 --> 03:28:44,810
per toponym that then pass through a

2688
03:28:44,930 --> 03:28:48,830
series of checks where the candidates are ranked,

2689
03:28:49,310 --> 03:28:52,310
and the ones that fall below a certain

2690
03:28:53,310 --> 03:28:55,270
threshold are removed.

2691
03:28:56,390 --> 03:29:00,230
And the surviving ones are then passed to

2692
03:29:00,370 --> 03:29:04,190
a next step with an LLM detect

2693
03:29:04,570 --> 03:29:08,010
