2695
03:29:12,430 --> 03:29:16,410
best match. The model can keep a single

2696
03:29:16,470 --> 03:29:19,750
best match with no reservation, and it is

2697
03:29:19,850 --> 03:29:23,590
accepted, or it can keep a single match,

2698
03:29:24,050 --> 03:29:27,830
but with some uncertainty. And in this way, in this

2699
03:29:27,890 --> 03:29:30,670
case, it flag it as in need for human review.

2700
03:29:31,210 --> 03:29:35,050
The model can also choose to reject all the candidates and return

2701
03:29:35,110 --> 03:29:38,610
no answer. In these last two cases, we also ask the

2702
03:29:38,670 --> 03:29:42,630
