2703
03:29:42,690 --> 03:29:43,330
its action.

2704
03:29:45,150 --> 03:29:47,610
Then there is a final step for

2705
03:29:48,429 --> 03:29:52,210
localities that contains a spatial relation, where a

2706
03:29:52,310 --> 03:29:55,730
script adjusts the coordinate and the related

2707
03:29:56,030 --> 03:29:59,190
uncertainty. And this is the full pipeline.

