identify specimens, either with keys or illustrations,

4304
06:46:04,126 --> 06:46:07,726
the things you do with people. So that's stretching out into digital

4305
06:46:07,766 --> 06:46:09,346
humanities and history of science research,

4306
06:46:10,326 --> 06:46:13,446
and the way we understand where our specimens

4307
06:46:14,246 --> 06:46:17,826
and species exist. So spatial data, things like

