06:46:36,326 --> 06:46:38,066
numerically here, but

4314
06:46:40,506 --> 06:46:44,346
this page, it's basically a printed out database, isn't it, before

4315
06:46:44,386 --> 06:46:45,626
someone had database access.

4316
06:46:46,906 --> 06:46:50,526
So it's an entry of a person. There's tons of structured

