4423
06:52:38,262 --> 06:52:38,542
And

4424
06:52:39,862 --> 06:52:42,902
people are always going to want things like that, that's what funders like.

4425
06:52:44,742 --> 06:52:45,022
But this

4426
06:52:46,022 --> 06:52:49,882
model that GBIF have built and provided is a way that you can

4427
06:52:49,922 --> 06:52:53,702
serve that need for a funder, and you can also serve that need as a user

4428
06:52:53,742 --> 06:52:54,402
community too.

4429
06:52:55,742 --> 06:52:59,642
And I would glibly say, we always say don't judge a book by its cover,

