08:05:37,228 --> 08:05:39,068
BHL content at large.

5190
08:05:40,048 --> 08:05:43,488
So this is a first demonstrator of a new working group at

5191
08:05:43,548 --> 08:05:44,488
Senckenberg, the

5192
08:05:45,448 --> 08:05:47,688
Semantic Data Systems and Knowledge Engineering group.

5193
08:05:47,788 --> 08:05:51,648
So, be kind with your comments. So we're just starting this,

5194
08:05:52,368 --> 08:05:56,008
and we really would like to build on really making entomological

5195
08:05:56,048 --> 08:05:59,008
knowledge more available, more accessible for everybody.

5196
08:06:00,208 --> 08:06:04,128
So the few takeaways here, just to summarize, text and illustration

5197
08:06:04,188 --> 08:06:07,468
provide complementary evidence and should be regarded together.

5198
08:06:07,528 --> 08:06:11,428
I think there are more tools and technologies out there now that help us

5199
08:06:11,508 --> 08:06:15,448
to achieve that and not just look at the text alone.

5200
08:06:16,708 --> 08:06:20,348
We need to create alignment, or alignment creates connected

5201
08:06:20,368 --> 08:06:24,248
knowledge. So we want to really get these connections out and also

5202
08:06:24,668 --> 08:06:26,748
demonstrate these shared entities and

5203
08:06:27,668 --> 08:06:30,988
point out more about the traits and ecological interactions that actually are

5204
08:06:31,048 --> 08:06:33,288
contained in these publications.

5205
08:06:33,848 --> 08:06:37,428
And of course, we want to build on knowledge graphs that enable the

5206
08:06:37,488 --> 08:06:40,988
reuse of the knowledge in the publications themselves

5207
08:06:41,548 --> 08:06:43,608
and want to extend this to other collections.

