08:14:21,288 --> 08:14:24,868
This is actually inspired by a group I met in Davos who wanted to get all the

5335
08:14:24,908 --> 08:14:28,588
papers in BHL for every island in the world, and you can essentially

5336
08:14:28,908 --> 08:14:31,068
do that. Is that what we want for maps?

