08:15:20,252 --> 08:15:22,432
There's been various sort of attempts to sort of explore this.

5351
08:15:23,232 --> 08:15:25,352
Mike Trinsey at the Smithsonian was one of the first.

5352
08:15:25,392 --> 08:15:28,992
He came up with a neat little tool, which basically you stick in an image,

5353
08:15:29,572 --> 08:15:33,132
