5354
08:15:33,212 --> 08:15:35,452
Is it blank? Which is a really useful kind of thing to do.

5355
08:15:35,892 --> 08:15:38,052
Traditionally, BHL has done that manually.

5356
08:15:39,412 --> 08:15:42,612
So inspired by some of the kind of models behind this, we can take this a bit

5357
08:15:42,692 --> 08:15:43,152
