08:16:02,992 --> 08:16:06,192
There's field reports, all kinds of stuff.

5364
08:16:06,772 --> 08:16:08,932
And here it's just arranged bibliographically.

5365
08:16:09,612 --> 08:16:13,592
So how would you find particular images that you want in that kind of

5366
08:16:13,652 --> 08:16:14,092
