08:16:51,752 --> 08:16:54,831
Has anybody published anything on that plant specimen? I'm going to speed up now.

5379
08:16:55,652 --> 08:16:59,012
You can actually search for that herbarium specimen, and indeed, yes,

5380
08:16:59,772 --> 08:17:01,552
